# The test site

Welcome to the test server. This paragraph is a long line of text that the client must wrap to the width of its screen, because gemtext leaves wrapping to the client and an 80-column screen holds less than most lines of prose.

## Links

=> /input Ask me something
=> /secret A password prompt
=> /redirect A redirect to the front page
=> /loop A redirect loop
=> /gone Something that is not there
=> /slow A server asking for a pause
=> /big A very big document
=> /binary Not text
=> /latin Latin-1 text
=> nested/page.gmi A page in a directory (relative link)
=> gemini://geminiprotocol.net/ The project's own capsule (absolute link)
=> gopher://gopher.floodgap.com/ A gopher link (another scheme)
=>/nospace A link with no space after the arrow
=>	/tab	A link with tabs

